Monitor and control garage door

uses gpiozero
insure that RPi.GPIO module is installed in virtual environment
uses web sockets

2024-01-10 updated scope of octime to global
           corrected determining last octime on startup gw_web.py

2024-01-11 updated .gitignore

2024-02-24 updated systemd service units

2024-06-04 gw_log.py uses file gw_door_state file to send status
	   updates to gw_web.py

	   gw_web.py sends SIGUSR1 (10) to gw_log.py to activate
	   door

	   gw_web.py sends SIGUSR2 (12) to gw_log.py to indicate
	   that Bad Pin was entered to gw_web.py

2024-08-27 modified gw_log.py and gw_Functions.py to handle Exceptions.
	   
	   gw_log.py imports myclasses.py
	   
	   Uses myError Class object to capture exception type and
	   description

2024-08-28 stop using gw_door_state file to send status
		   updates to gw_web.py

		   gw_web sends signal 60 to gw_log to indicate gw_web
		   has started

		   gw_log sends signals to gw_web to indicate:
		   60 - door open
		   61 - door closed
		   62 - door opening
		   63 - door closing
		   
2024-09-04 Modified /Log route in gw_web.py to show one log day
		   at a time	

2024-10-10 fixed bug in gw_web.py to send door activation signal

2024-10-13 gw_web.py updated to handle multiple clients
           builds list of attached clients then sends door status
           updates to all clients in list

2025-02-14 updated gw_web.py to run in gunicorn web server
			- gw_web.py uses gw_door_state to determine door state

2025-02-26 updated gw_log.py error handling
